OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 9 FEB
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: Vivaldi in a Warming
OL,5,     FWorld
OL,6,     GKate Molleson talks with Magnus
OL,7,     GLindberg, who takes us back to
OL,8,     Ghis 1985 piece Kraft , one of the
OL,9,     Ggreat sonic rumpuses of the late
OL,10,     G20th century.
OL,11,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,12,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,13,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,14,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,15,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,16,     Geverything in between.
OL,17,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,18,     GThe rising Belgian trombonist and
OL,19,     Gbandleader is giving out four
OL,20,     Gbouquets this week.
